  unitName: Pure Lady Cyan
  unitId: 30674
  unitNumber: 1096
  description: A demon who swore her fealty to the nation of Estoria in ancient Ishgria.
    Cyan was often harassed by other demons for being a lesser, weaker demon until
    Savia saw her hidden potential, and took Cyan under her wing. Cyan then decided
    to repay the favor by dedicating her life to serve Savia, which was very unusual
    for a demon to do, and did her best to improve on her abilities to meet the expectations
    of her mistress. She eventually became as strong as some of the higher ranking
    demons, but by that point she was only interested in using her powers in the
    name of her queen, and nothing else.
  summonDesc: I have no interest in another master.<br>I shall only follow your directions.<br>Thus
    if I revolt,<br>there are no consequences.
  fusionDesc: To think I can set my own limits.<br>I'm as foolish as ever.<br>What
    do you think?
